          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " good.",
          "start": 1521.93,
          "end": 1522.21,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "What, what was the question again? Oh, Rab (\u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651), Lord.",
