        },
        {
          "word": " disaster.",
          "start": 2870.42,
          "end": 2870.92,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is why when they walk into this mosque, they're shocked to see a woman's hair.",
