        },
        {
          "word": " Shari'a.",
          "start": 3265.84,
          "end": 3266.48,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, I don't know how many months or years later she married somebody else.",
      "start": 3267.82,
      "end": 3273.92,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 3267.82,
          "end": 3268.04,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 3269.26,
          "end": 3269.36,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " don't",
          "start": 3269.36,
          "end": 3269.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " know",
          "start": 3269.5,
          "end": 3269.62,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " how",
          "start": 3269.62,
          "end": 3269.76,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " many",
          "start": 3269.76,
          "end": 3271.38,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " months",
          "start": 3271.38,
          "end": 3271.84,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " or",
          "start": 3271.84,
          "end": 3272.04,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " years",
          "start": 3272.04,
          "end": 3272.18,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " later",
          "start": 3272.18,
          "end": 3272.54,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " she",
          "start": 3272.54,
          "end": 3272.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " married",
          "start": 3272.82,
          "end": 3273.02,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " somebody",
          "start": 3273.02,
          "end": 3273.4,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " else.",
          "start": 3273.4,
          "end": 3273.92,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, her former husband complained, and they ruled that she and her new husband have committed adultery.",
      "start": 3275.04,
      "end": 3287.31,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Now,",
          "start": 3275.04,
          "end": 3275.2,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " her",
          "start": 3275.28,
          "end": 3275.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " former",
          "start": 3275.88,
          "end": 3278.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " husband",
          "start": 3278.1,
          "end": 3278.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " complained,",
          "start": 3278.5,
          "end": 3280.46,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 3280.62,
