          "end": 3286.56,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " adultery.",
          "start": 3286.56,
          "end": 3287.31,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, the judge ordered them stoned to death.",
      "start": 3287.74,
      "end": 3289.56,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 3287.74,
          "end": 3287.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3287.88,
          "end": 3287.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " judge",
          "start": 3287.88,
          "end": 3288.0,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " ordered",
          "start": 3288.0,
          "end": 3288.36,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " them",
          "start": 3288.36,
          "end": 3288.56,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " stoned",
          "start": 3288.56,
          "end": 3288.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 3288.88,
          "end": 3289.08,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " death.",
          "start": 3289.08,
          "end": 3289.56,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And 4 of their friends, also stoned to death, because they knew about it.",
