          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the kind of mentality that is...",
      "start": 3303.5,
      "end": 3305.48,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " This",
          "start": 3303.5,
          "end": 3303.66,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3303.66,
          "end": 3303.8,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3303.8,
          "end": 3303.92,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " kind",
          "start": 3303.92,
          "end": 3304.08,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 3304.08,
          "end": 3304.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " mentality",
          "start": 3304.28,
          "end": 3304.54,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " that",
          "start": 3304.54,
          "end": 3304.98,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is...",
          "start": 3304.98,
          "end": 3305.48,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Where their women are oppressed.",
      "start": 3308.02,
      "end": 3314.94,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Where",
          "start": 3308.02,
          "end": 3308.14,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " their",
          "start": 3310.82,
          "end": 3312.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " women",
          "start": 3312.86,
          "end": 3313.12,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " are",
          "start": 3313.12,
          "end": 3313.32,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " oppressed.",
          "start": 3313.32,
          "end": 3314.94,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And we read in Sura 28 that God feels for the oppressed, and He makes it up to them.",
